## Task: Create ProgressIndicator component
## Step: write-tests

Create ProgressIndicator.tsx and .css in web/src/renderers/develop/.

Props: { phases: DevelopPhaseInfo[] }

Renders a horizontal flex bar of phases in order. Each phase: icon + label. Status determines style: completed=green check+dimmed text; active=accent color+bold+highlight; pending=muted+dimmed. Between phases: a connector line (green for completed transitions, gray otherwise). Scrollable horizontally if overflow.

CSS: .progress-indicator { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: var(--engin-space-sm) var(--engin-space-md); background: var(--engin-bg-secondary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--engin-border); overflow-x: auto; gap: var(--engin-space-xs); flex-shrink: 0; }
.phase-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--engin-space-xs); white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12px; }
.phase-connector { width: 20px; height: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }

Verification: cd web && bunx tsc --noEmit passes.

